  "description": {
    "ja": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (ja): ヤナギタデ",
      "source_url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%A4%E3%83%8A%E3%82%AE%E3%82%BF%E3%83%87",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 108735913,
      "text": "ヤナギタデ は、タデ科イヌタデ属の一年草。水辺などに生える雑草。和名は、葉がヤナギに似ていることから。マタデ（真蓼）、ホンタデ（本蓼）、カワタデ、ナガボヤナギタデともいう。"
    },
    "en": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (en): Persicaria hydropiper",
      "source_url": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persicaria_hydropiper",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 1373674118,
      "text": "Persicaria hydropiper, also known as water pepper, marshpepper knotweed, arse smart or tade, is a plant of the family Polygonaceae. A widespread species, Persicaria hydropiper is found in Australia, New Zealand, temperate Asia, Europe and North America. The plant grows in damp places and shallow water. Cultivated varieties are eaten in East Asia for their pungent flavor."
    },
    "es": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (es): Polygonum hydropiper",
      "source_url": "https://es.wikipedia.org/wiki/Polygonum_hydropiper",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 175383090,
      "text": "La pimienta del agua Polygonum hydropiper, sinónimo de Persicaria hydropiper, es una planta de la familia Polygonaceae que crece en la zona templada del hemisferio norte en lugares húmedos, umbríos y encharcados. Se utiliza como especia por su sabor acre. En México se llama chilillo y en Cuba, hierba del sapo."
    },
    "fr": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (fr): Persicaria hydropiper",
      "source_url": "https://fr.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persicaria_hydropiper",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 224392166,
      "text": "Persicaria hydropiper (L.) Spach ou Persicaria hydropiper (L.) Delarbre, la Renouée poivre d'eau - parfois appelée curage - est une espèce de plantes herbacées de la famille des Polygonacées qui pousse dans des zones humides, éventuellement semi-immergée dans les ruisseaux, les fossés inondés."
    },
    "pt": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (pt): Persicaria hydropiper",
      "source_url": "https://pt.wikipedia.org/wiki/Persicaria_hydropiper",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 72047671,
      "text": "Polygonum hydropiper é uma espécie de planta com flor pertencente à família Polygonaceae."
    },
    "id": {
      "source": "Wikipedia (id): Si tuba sawah",
      "source_url": "https://id.wikipedia.org/wiki/Si_tuba_sawah",
      "license": "CC BY-SA 4.0",
      "license_url": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/",
      "retrieved": "2026-10-14",
      "revision": 29080183,
      "text": "Persicaria hydropiper, juga dikenal sebagai lada air, si tuba sawah, rumput arse atau tade, adalah tanaman dari famili Polygonaceae. Spesies yang tersebar luas, Persicaria hydropiper ditemukan di Australia, Selandia Baru, Asia beriklim sedang, Eropa dan Amerika Utara. Tanaman ini tumbuh di tempat lembap dan perairan dangkal. Varietas yang dibudidayakan dimakan di Asia Timur karena rasanya yang pedas."
    }
  },
